<li><a name="2" id="n2"></a>&ldquo;Holding  the Line: Bernanke, Fed Colleagues Decide to Keep Rates Steady; Even Dallas&rsquo; Fisher Concurs,&rdquo; <em>The Dallas  Morning News</em>, Sept. 17,   2008, p. 1D.</li>
<li><a name="3" id="n3"></a> &ldquo;Ben  First, Economy Last,&rdquo; by Julian Delasantellis, <em>Asia Times</em>, Sept.   18, 2008.</li>
