<li><a name="8" id="n8"></a> <a href="fs080528.cfm">&ldquo;Storms  on the Horizon,&rdquo;</a> by Richard W.  Fisher, remarks before the Commonwealth Club of California, San Francisco, May 28, 2008.</li>
<li><a name="9" id="n9"></a>&ldquo;Washington Must Heed Fiscal  Alarm Bell,&rdquo; by David Walker, Peter G. Peterson Foundation, Sept. 22, 2008,  <a href="http://www.pgpf.org/newsroom/oped/ft/">www.pgpf.org/newsroom/oped/ft/</a>.</li>
<li><a name="10" id="n10"></a>&ldquo;Capitalism in Convulsion:  Toxic Assets Head Towards the Public Balance Sheet,&rdquo; by John Plender, <em>Financial Times</em>, Sept. 19, 2008, <a href="http://www.ft.com/cms/s/0/b210deec-8675-11dd-959e-0000779fd18c.html">www.ft.com/cms/s/0/b210deec-8675-11dd-959e-0000779fd18c.html</a>.</li>
<li><a name="11" id="n11"></a>&ldquo;A Time of Unexampled Prosperity,&rdquo; by Washington  Irving, in <em>The Crayon Papers</em>, 1890.</li>
